Propose fit changes and preview the outcome WITHOUT modifying the user's actual fit. Applies each edit to a copy of the attached fit and returns the projected stats and validation issues. Edit ops: {"op":"add_module","slot_type":"high|medium|low|rig","type_id":<int>,"state":"active|online|passive|overload"?,"charge_type_id":<int>?}; {"op":"remove_module","slot_type":...,"index":<int>}; {"op":"set_module_charge","slot_type":...,"index":<int>,"charge_type_id":<int>?}; {"op":"set_module_state","slot_type":...,"index":<int>,"state":...}. This is a what-if simulation: the user must still make the change in the fitting editor. Use `search_items` to resolve an item name to a `type_id` first.
